                                "example_id": "2c24243f-bd39-44f4-96cc-2985449cdadc",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "Bell: Savino didn't tip you off to that bitch?\nWee-Bey: Pshh, wasn't no time for that. He get up out the car, we see him go up the block like we said, right? Pshh, after that, he outa sight, we bring it home like we planned, baby.\nBell: Well, shorty was a cop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e36dcb9b-51dd-4209-94ed-1254d71b217b",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "Shorty really killed this 😭"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2508567b-a636-4aa3-b31d-276bab285135",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "I asked shorty for her name and she said “earn it”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16247831-bac3-40c4-827e-26b19b6418df",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "Shorty said"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d7e00db-53b5-4568-bd4e-c7031d0a9f3f",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "shorty concussed and she said not my problem 😭"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1663a40b-0a38-4388-81cc-36b3739b8979",
                                "sense_id": "9c26eeb9-31f1-31e8-a668-f656bef9b979",
                                "text": "Me tryna show shorty I’m just as useful as that toy"
                            }
                        ]
